                        "sense_id": "5e9e8b8f-bf7e-3487-becf-89807ce1eeb6",
                        "entry_id": "372fe4b8-7d38-33d5-82a5-f8af99fc4981",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An inexperienced climber."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory",
                            "slang",
                            "sometimes"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd44f5af-2ac1-4adf-9943-bc37480a7084",
                                "sense_id": "5e9e8b8f-bf7e-3487-becf-89807ce1eeb6",
                                "text": "Eddy Delwood wove an exaggerated tale about him. It was a story about the day's big climb.\n\"So the gumby's up there fifteen minutes now...He's not movin', just standin' there.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0c5306f0-d978-43ea-8db1-6dccf2101300",
                                "sense_id": "5e9e8b8f-bf7e-3487-becf-89807ce1eeb6",
                                "text": "\"Beattie...What's a gumby?\"\n\"It's what I thought you were the first day: a beginner, a rookie, green as grass and wet behind the ears. Something you've never been, Spider-Man. Though the way you climbed just now...well...\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "89a840d5-00e9-44af-9b55-5a6215fb0915",
                                "sense_id": "5e9e8b8f-bf7e-3487-becf-89807ce1eeb6",
                                "text": "You do notice one guy (not a gumby, he's done A5 climbs) who doesn't really hoist any equipment, never leads the climb, never finds routes, and conveniently forgets to bring his ropes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "86ba18c8-00a4-4cc0-a273-740896114630",
                                "sense_id": "5e9e8b8f-bf7e-3487-becf-89807ce1eeb6",
                                "text": "Caroline was silent. Probably standing there, watching with pity. Or maybe she'd left. Why would she stay to watch the gumby climb anyway?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
